Compliance & third-party notice
--------------------------------
This launcher is an INDEPENDENT, clean-room implementation. It was written
from Mojang/Microsoft public metadata & HTTP APIs, and from the OFFICIAL,
publicly distributed installer JARs of Forge / NeoForge / Fabric / Quilt
(which are executed, not copied or modified). It does NOT contain, derive
from, or link against the source code of any other launcher.

Notably:
- PCL2 source is NOT used (its license/terms are restrictive and forbid reuse).
- HMCL source is NOT used (GPLv3; this project is MIT and independent).
- Prism Launcher, XMCL, BMCLAPI were studied only at the level of publicly
  documented behavior (file layouts, API endpoints) and re-implemented.

All Minecraft assets, game files, and mods remain the property of their
respective owners and are downloaded from official or operator-chosen sources
at runtime.
